      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A powerful attack is to argue the **poverty trap and inflationary risk**, asserting that a massive, unconditional money injection without a massive increase in the labor supply will only drive up the cost of essential goods like rent and food, effectively negating the benefit of the UBI for the very poor.\n\nFurthermore, challenge the **\"unconditional\" premise politically and morally** by arguing that it is a massive surrender of the \"social contract,\" essentially institutionalizing dependency and undermining the inherent right and duty to contribute to a community for basic support.",
